   "by": "research-r077",
   "run": "provenance-research-2026-10-23",
   "note": "Davison says Miya dubbed it 'Frequently Answered Questions'; Miya himself credited Mark Horton's earlier 18-question post for the format, but the FAQ name on the space list is attributed to Miya"
